      <chord name="G"/>All people <chord name="Em"/>that <chord name="Bm"/>on <chord name="Em"/>earth <chord name="D"/>do <chord name="G"/>dwell, Sing to the <chord name="D"/>Lord <chord name="Em"/>with <chord name="C"/>cheerful <chord name="D"/>voice;<br/>
